# bare daypart surfaces lexically fused with TODAY: "vanavond"/"vanochtend"/
# "vanmorgen" already name today's own band, unlike the plain band words
# "avond"/"ochtend" (which compose with the clock's own future-roll rule --
# see test_nl_r117 in the en corpus for the documented convention).
vanavond
vanochtend
vanmorgen
